{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o068b","title":"曹叡崩嘉福殿","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o068b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"曹叡崩嘉福殿","evidence":["mingdi-e-o068b-q"]},{"id":"mingdi-a-p061-disputes","label":"裴注·裴松之按","text":"正文记三十六岁；裴松之据定邺、纳甄及改正朔，认为整三十四年，强称三十五亦不得三十六。","evidence":["mingdi-q-p061-disputes"]},{"id":"wgc-a-1-e36","label":"正文","text":"曹叡驾崩","evidence":["wgc-q0249","wgc-q0250"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"崩","evidence":["mingdi-e-o068b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"嘉福殿","evidence":["mingdi-e-o068b-q"]},"time":{"year":239,"label":"正月丁亥","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y239","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o068","basis":"正月丁亥"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o068b-q","mingdi-q-o068","mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o068b-q","source_order":[3,492,"O068b"],"order":972}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o068b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-15faf626ce48eb2f68b4","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，丁亥〖4〗，太尉宣王还至河内；帝驿马召到〖5〗，引入卧内，执其手谓曰：“吾疾甚！以后事属君。君其与爽辅少子〖6〗。吾得见君，无所恨！”宣王顿首流涕〖7〗。﹝一﹞即日，帝崩于嘉福殿。﹝二﹞时年三十六〖8〗。﹝三﹞癸丑〖9〗，葬高平陵〖10〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗三年：景初三年（公元 239）。丁亥：旧历初一日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":496,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-271e1436daf6e49feb83","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o068","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-15faf626ce48eb2f68b4","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，丁亥〖4〗，太尉宣王还至河内；帝驿马召到〖5〗，引入卧内，执其手谓曰：“吾疾甚！以后事属君。君其与爽辅少子〖6〗。吾得见君，无所恨！”宣王顿首流涕〖7〗。﹝一﹞即日，帝崩于嘉福殿。﹝二﹞时年三十六〖8〗。﹝三﹞癸丑〖9〗，葬高平陵〖10〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-p061-disputes","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-eb84f80fad82c99b23d6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞臣松之按：魏武以建安九年八月定邺，文帝始纳甄后，明帝应以十年生；计至此年正月，整三十四年耳。时改正朔，以故年十二月为今年正月；可强名三十五年，不得三十六也。","attribution":"裴注·裴松之按","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":506,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d7c36a52d83801a90873","start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0249","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a3292814312d44f1b69c","layer":"original","quote":"会帝崩","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":3,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0250","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a3292814312d44f1b69c","layer":"original","quote":"会帝崩，正始初，玄等并在职。复以诞为御史中丞、尚书。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
